Z||000073||Mach10||08-15-2001||08:23 PM||||From "One-Liners: 076.101" (or more popularly known as Army of Darkness)<P>-It got into my hand, made it bad, so I lopped it off!<P>-Right now, you're ruling jack and **** . And you know what? Jack just just left.<P>-All right you primates, this is my *BOOM* stick!<P>-From S-Mart's sporting goods section. S-Mart's Top of the Line. 12-gauge Winchester. wooden stock. Hair-trigger. All for about 109.99. Shop smart, shop S-Mart. (jumps, waves gun, crowd cowers in fear) YOU GOT THAT?!?<P>-Little goodie-two-shoes! Little goodie(THUD)Two-shoes! Little goodie(THUD)Two-shoes!<P>-Good, Bad, I'm the one with the Gun.<P>-I... Live... Again!<P>-Aw, baby, that was just, you-know, pillowtalk!<P>-Baby, you got UGLY.<P>-Well, maybe not EVERY little syllable, but yeah, I said 'em<P>-I'm Ash. Of Housewares.<P>-Hail to the King, Baby!<P>From "Quest for the Holy Grail:<P>-Why should we?<BR>-Because I am your King.<BR>-I didn't Vote for you!<BR>-You don't VOTE for kings<BR>-How'd you become king then? <BR>-The lady of the lake, arms clad in the finest white lace, drew forth excaliber and gave it to me. That is why I'm your king.<BR>-Hang, on! soggy tarts distributing swords is no basis for a system of government! Why, if I walked around, declaring I was king because some watery bink lobbed a scimitar at me, they'd put me away!<P>-What? You're arms off<BR>-No it isn't! <BR>-It's right there!<BR>-That's just a flesh wound! I've had worse<BR>-You're a bleeding liar.<BR>-Have at you!<BR>*chops other arm off*<BR>-Fight, you coward! <BR>-You've got no arms!<BR>-Yes I have!<BR>-No you don't.<BR>-Fight!<BR>-What are you going to do? Bleed on me?!?<BR>*Dark knight starts kicking Arthur. Arthur chops legs off*<BR>-All right, we'll call it a draw.<BR>-We're leaving<BR>-COME BACK YOU BASTARDS! I'LL BITE YOUR LEGS OFF!<P>Those are my favorites.||||reg||10
